      ],
      "returnType": "PseudoIndex",
      "docs": "/// Array serialization.\nfriend Stream & operator<< ( Stream & s, Array<T> & p )\n{\nif( s.isLoading() ) {\nuint size;\ns << size;\np.resize( size );\n}\nelse {\ns << p.m_size;\n}\nfor( uint i = 0; i < p.m_size; i++ ) {\ns << p.m_buffer[i];\n}\nreturn s;\n}"
